 "stimulus_html": "<p>Use the given information for problems 4 – 6. Technology is required. Function <span data-math=\"f\">f</span> is defined by <span data-math=\"f(x)=3x+5\">f(x)=3x+5</span>, and function <span data-math=\"g\">g</span>\n is defined by <span data-math=\"g(x)=(1.1)^x\">g(x)=(1.1)^x</span>.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered os-raise-doubleheadertable\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th scope=\"col\">\n</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">        <span data-math=\"f(x)\">f(x)</span></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">        <span data-math=\"g(x)\">g(x)</span></th>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">\n        1\n      </th>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">\n        5\n      </th>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">\n        10\n      </th>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"row\">\n        20\n      </th>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n <br>",
