   "stem_html": "<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\" start=\"8\" type=\"1\">\n  <li>Functions <span data-math=\"m\">m</span> and <span data-math=\"n\">n</span> are given by <span data-math=\"m(x)=(1.05)^x\">m(x)=(1.05)^x</span> and <span data-math=\"n(x)=\\frac{5}{8}x\">n(x)=\\frac{5}{8}x</span>. As <span data-math=\"x\">x</span><em>\n</em>increases from 0, __________ reaches 100 first.</li>\n</ol>",
